<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1538_5563.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> dienst und gruoß alle
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear> liebs und guots <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> vor, Edel Ehrnvest,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fromb</unclear> fürsichtig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eersam</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Weyse</unclear> Insonders
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günstig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lieb</unclear> Herren.
<lb n="5"/>Es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erscheint</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auf</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heüt</unclear> siner dato vor unß
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ingeseßnem</unclear> <orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rhat</unclear></orgName>, unser Burgerin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Noll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Brackh</unclear>,
<lb n="7"/>mit beystand ires <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vormünders</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bartholomej</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Singers</unclear></persName> unsers Burgers, hoch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">klagende</unclear>, wie daß
<lb n="9"/>sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obgemelte</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Brackhin</unclear></persName> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ieren</unclear> kindern In
<lb n="10"/>hohem alter so gar an kindtlicher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">trew</unclear>, liebe
<lb n="11"/>hilff und steür <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlaßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dermaßen</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> iro nit möglich, bey <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">huß</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">güetlin</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>ohn verhandlet zuo verbleiben. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wart</unclear> deß-
<lb n="14"/>wegen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> hohes blödes alter, mit leibsnarung
<lb n="15"/>bey hiesiger <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dochter</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Elisabeta</persName> durch obgemelte
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">huß</unclear> und güetlin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berathn</unclear>.
<lb n="17"/>Wan aber unß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> fürnemen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorhabend</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>contract gegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehörter</unclear> hiesiger <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dochter</unclear> ohn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorwüßen</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kindern</unclear> zuo confirmieren, in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">keinen</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>weg will gebüren. So glangt an
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Euwer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. und W. unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlichs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansinnen</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>und begeren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wöllend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Euwer</unclear> burgerin <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Margarita</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Singerin</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Weylund</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Johann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wirzen</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tischmachers</unclear>
<lb n="24"/>haußfrawen als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obgemelter</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Noll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Brackhin</unclear></persName> dochter,
<lb n="25"/>für Eüch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">citirn</unclear>, dieselbigen alles <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vleißes</unclear>
<lb n="26"/>befragen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">examinirn</unclear>, wie sie gegen der
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muodter</unclear> gesinnet, ob sie wölle sich ires <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">güetlins</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verzihen</unclear>, oder aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">güetlin</unclear> wölle <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">helfen</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>retten und handthaben: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Alß</unclear> dan unß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>antwurt und resolution, zuor nachrichtung
<lb n="31"/>bey <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeigern</unclear> diß, schrifftlich laßen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuokhomen</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1538_5564.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">das</unclear> begerend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wier</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fählen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear>
